WEBVTT

00:04:28.514 --> 00:04:31.142
and I didn't handle that pressure well.

00:04:31.934 --> 00:04:34.562
I got really, really anxious.

00:04:35.855 --> 00:04:37.523
Do I really belong here?

00:04:38.399 --> 00:04:41.068
How long until they find out I'm a fraud?

00:04:41.861 --> 00:04:44.030
The questions paralyzed me.

00:04:44.071 --> 00:04:47.450
I was absolutely terrified
to make mistakes,

00:04:47.491 --> 00:04:50.286
and I was desperate
for others' validation.

00:04:50.661 --> 00:04:52.997
It followed me around 24/7.

00:04:53.456 --> 00:04:56.000
I got to where I couldn't eat
before games,

00:04:56.042 --> 00:04:58.127
I constantly felt nauseous.

00:04:58.627 --> 00:05:02.631
I'd be at the dinner table with my wife
or some friends, and I just ...